{
  "//": [
    "Firestore automatically indexes every single field, so a query with ONE equality",
    "filter and no ordering needs nothing declared here. Almost every read RECLAIM issues",
    "is exactly that shape, which is why this file is short.",
    "",
    "The first two entries are REQUIRED today — they are the only two multi-filter queries",
    "in the codebase, and without them those reads fail with FAILED_PRECONDITION:",
    "  · recovery_cases (merchantId + sourceId)  — the case de-duplication lookup",
    "  · recovery_cases (merchantId + status)    — the detection guard on startup",
    "",
    "The remainder support the ordered, server-paged reads described under 'Scale notes'",
    "in docs/firestore-schema.md. They are declared ahead of that change because deploying",
    "an index is slow and discovering the need in production is worse; they cost storage",
    "and nothing else until a query uses them."
  ],

  "indexes": [
    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "sourceId", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },

    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "priorityScore", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_cases",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "detectedAt", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "payments",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "customerId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "createdAt", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "payments",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "createdAt", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_actions",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "caseId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "createdAt", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "recovery_outcomes",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "outcome", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "recordedAt", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "audit_logs",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "seq", "order": "DESCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "audit_logs",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "caseId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "seq", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "collectionGroup": "invoices",
      "queryScope": "COLLECTION",
      "fields": [
        { "fieldPath": "merchantId", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "status", "order": "ASCENDING" },
        { "fieldPath": "dueAt", "order": "ASCENDING" }
      ]
    }
  ],

  "fieldOverrides": []
}
